  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T13:42:23.935728Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T13:53:43.840037Z",
  "totalBlocks": 29,
  "translatedBlocks": 29,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c5d414ff86a698b",
      "translationZh": "我之前就有一个版本，叫 AOS，是我在桌面端配置的智能体。我把它整合成了一个手机应用，所需功能都内置了，也去掉了所有不必要的东西。既然 Muse 和 Grok 都出来了，我想干脆也把它发出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ecd8cd6e4b0d25d",
      "translationZh": "它基本上就是 Hermes Agent，只不过运行在你的手机上。它始终在线，会了解你平时做什么，并像私人助理一样帮你处理事情。它有自己的浏览器，所以真的可以上网把事情办好。如果遇到验证码或登录而卡住，它会把页面交给你，等你处理完后再继续。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6427a75aa2d0383e",
      "translationZh": "除了向你所使用的模型发起的调用之外，没有任何数据会离开你的手机。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18f606e676090ed4",
      "translationZh": "免费、开源，不是商业产品。使用风险自负。Claude 登录方式可能违反 Anthropic 的条款，所以这部分责任得由你自己承担。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f0ebd8dddbbd554",
      "translationZh": "需要 Android 10+，侧载安装 APK，设置只需一分钟。详情见 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfb37af7c0c29d60",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/Past-da-king/agent",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3a2272bc9931d6fd",
      "translationZh": "下载（v0.5.0）：https://github.com/Past-da-king/agent/releases/tag/v0.5.0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d5ada9d673cea82",
      "translationZh": "如果你想了解更多，这里有它的工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adcfd0197bd98d5b",
      "translationZh": "应用通过 Composio 连接，使用你自己的密钥，因此 Gmail、Calendar 以及其他几百款应用都能直接使用。对于 Composio 上没有的服务，它会自己编写代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a43e5d393cf4009",
      "translationZh": "它还可以替你盯着网站。比如，你想买某样东西，但还在等它降价。它会为那个网站编写一个小型监测程序，每天在你指定的时间在后台运行，只有价格确实发生变化时才通知你。它还可以监听网站的网页通知，并把这些通知当作触发条件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a044fa51909176a",
      "translationZh": "它的记忆是一个 wiki，基于 Karpathy 的 LLM wiki 构想。它了解到的每个人、每件事都会有各自的页面，并与其他页面相互链接，因此它能持久记住自己做过的一切。它预先设置了一个例行任务，会在夜里你不用手机的时候维护这个 wiki。你可以编辑或删除这个任务，但它已经在那里了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c76fa85e503a785a",
      "translationZh": "你可以用它做这些事：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5806d684dc208fc3",
      "translationZh": "蹲守护照或签证预约页面，一有人取消预约，就立刻抢下空出的名额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b18b6ce6d96c275",
      "translationZh": "盯着已售罄演唱会的转售页面，一出现按票面价出售的门票就抢下来。它会先保留门票，等你点头确认。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61db63c4e09b2703",
      "translationZh": "盯着一家你怎么也订不到位子的餐厅，一出现取消预订的情况，就拿下空出的餐位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e693bd7f85d0f102",
      "translationZh": "在 Marketplace 上盯着某一款非常特定的老式镜头，一上架就把照片发给你，赶在其他人发消息询问之前。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "614d463484884714",
      "translationZh": "把你家庭群聊里的 300 条未读消息变成一段 30 秒的语音消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad10c06509e9723f",
      "translationZh": "每次你的讲师上传幻灯片时，都把它们下载下来，并给你发送一份语音摘要，供你通勤时收听。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b80dff448385faa9",
      "translationZh": "午夜预约名额一开放，就帮你预订健身房早上 6 点的课程，这样你就不用为此熬夜了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fec299e495ba1ec2",
      "translationZh": "关注这个代码仓库，在 Agent 有新版本时告诉你。或者，当你依赖的任何代码仓库发布新版本时，它可以阅读更新日志，告诉你其中是否有任何变更会导致你现有的配置无法正常运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0a00894ccce8394",
      "translationZh": "在你妈妈的航班确实落地后告诉你，让你能在合适的时间出发去机场。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31be135b10dcbada",
      "translationZh": "开车时给它打电话，让它帮你找找沿途有什么还在营业的地方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fa9175660a0897f",
      "translationZh": "如果你添加用于语音的 ElevenLabs、Gemini 或 OpenAI 密钥，就可以使用语音消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e7f4eefa220df75f",
      "translationZh": "如果你添加 Gemini 密钥，就可以与你的智能体进行实时语音通话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ec80e2ea9396cfb",
      "translationZh": "它可以读取你的通知，但仅限于你选定的应用，并据此采取行动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6364cd82e75f805e",
      "translationZh": "聊天中的照片和文档，包括扫描版 PDF。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80f0a8c76b408c5a",
      "translationZh": "用于执行可并行运行任务的辅助智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4102b8ee75bd8e96",
      "translationZh": "你可以给它起个名字，并选择它的外观。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e58b3aaf841a0ee",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Choice-Lawyer4779 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
